  "person_4": "CAREGIVER"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Hello, come in, come in. Is it still pouring out there? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Chucking it down. I dropped Mum at the door and then it took me twenty minutes to park. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is this the right place? I'd like to see Dr Whitby. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'm Dr Whitby, Mrs Lowe, and this is the right place. How are you today? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh, very well, dear, apart from the telly, someone's moved my chair, and the girl who does my tea, she's from Spain, no, Portugal, no, I can't remember. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "I'm Priya, Mrs Lowe, I'm from Leicester. I come four times a day. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's it. Priya. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Doctor, it's the urine infections. She's had three since Christmas, and each time she gets muddled. This week she's confused again."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How is the confusion different from her usual?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "She didn't know me on Monday. She asked who I was, and then she thought it was morning when it was evening."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I knew you, Priya, I was just being silly. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I see. Mrs Lowe, any burning when you pass water?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit of a sting, yes. Down below."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "And she's going all the time, doctor. Every hour, Priya says."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "Every hour or so, yes. Even at night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever, shivering?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "No, her temperature's been normal, I check it with the ear thermometer."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any falls?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "No falls, thank goodness."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What medicines is she on?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Trimethoprim, 100 mg, at night, to prevent the infections. Amlodipine, 5 mg, once a day. And paracetamol, 500 mg, when she needs it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. Any conditions, Jean?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Recurrent urinary infections, obviously, and high blood pressure."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Dementia in the family, anything like that?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Her sister had dementia, yes."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Who's at home with her?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "She lives alone, with us coming in four times a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And what did she do for work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I was a nurse, dear, for forty years. I'd know a urine infection if I saw one."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'm sure you would. Let me check you. Pulse 82, blood pressure 138 over 76, temperature 36.9, oxygen 96 percent, breathing 16, and weight 59 kilos.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Is the temperature normal? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Yes. Mrs Lowe, I'm going to press gently on your tummy.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Mind my cardigan. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There's tenderness just above the pubic bone, in the lower tummy."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ooh, yes, that's the one. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Given the sting, the going every hour, and the confusion, this looks like another urine infection."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Not again. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's very common at her age. Make sure she drinks plenty of water through the day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_4",
   "t": "I'll keep a jug by her chair. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And keep an eye on how clear her thinking is. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "What if it doesn't clear up? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If she's still muddled in three days, or she gets a fever, get in touch and we'll see her again."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Three days. I'll ring. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thank you, doctor. Has someone moved my chair? ~"
  }
